content.text:
Now waypoint beam. Create gradient texture near mission definitions or use glowTex sprite stretched vertically? A radial glow sprite scaled (20, 200) would look like a vertical soft lozenge, fading at both ends — acceptable as a beam. Better create a dedicated texture with soft column: draw vertical linear gradient (bottom bright, top transparent) with horizontal radial fade. Let's make canvas 64x256 and draw using a linear gradient masked by horizontal gradient via globalCompositeOperation 'destination-in'.

```js
const beamCanvas=document.createElement('canvas'); 64x256;
const g=...;
const vert=g.createLinearGradient(0,256,0,0); vert.addColorStop(0,'rgba(255,255,255,.85)'); vert.addColorStop(.35,'rgba(255,255,255,.35)'); vert.addColorStop(1,'rgba(255,255,255,0)');
g.fillStyle=vert; g.fillRect(0,0,64,256);
const horiz=g.createLinearGradient(0,0,64,0); horiz.addColorStop(0,'rgba(0,0,0,0)'); horiz.addColorStop(.5,'rgba(0,0,0,1)'); horiz.addColorStop(1,'rgba(0,0,0,0)');
g.globalCompositeOperation='destination-in'; g.fillStyle=horiz; g.fillRect(0,0,64,256);
```
Then texture. Sprite scale (26, 240), position y=120, anchored center → beam from y=0 to 240 (sprite centered at 120). Good.

Replace cylinder beam in marker creation with sprite:
```js
const beam = new THREE.Sprite(new THREE.SpriteMaterial({map:beamTex,color,transparent:true,opacity:.8,blending:AdditiveBlending,depthWrite:false}));
beam.position.y=120; beam.scale.set(30,240,1);
```
Set color yellow/teal. In animate, opacity .6 + pulse .1.

Also keep pillar? Remove pillar cylinder (hard). I'll remove from group and adjust children indices (animate uses group.children[2] for pillar opacity). If we remove pillar, children: ring(0), ring2(1), beam(2) → the code sets children[2].material.opacity, which would be beam opacity; conflict. Update animate accordingly: remove that line, set beam sprite opacity. Let's restructure: group.add(ring, ring2, beam); animate sets m.mat color; beam visible active; beam.material.opacity.

Also m.group.visible is stage<4.

Implement texture near mission code, and change marker creation.

